New York, N.Y., 1947 Descended in family (Tibor de Nagy, New York, N.Y.) (Source: Georgia O'Keeffe Museum)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Whitney Archive indicates, \"Exam. at Amer. Place, April 1946.\"Whitney Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks indicate, \"on backing: 'Skunk Cabbage' 2nd series 23 [not verified]. This is almost identical to 'Cos Cob' which was painted in 1922. Probably 2nd series painted 1923.\" See cat. nos. 1943, 1944. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"18 x 14 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Gift of The Burnett Foundation","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Vertical canvas with large brown and reddish bean shape in the lower center that has a twisting stem rising out and up. From behind this is a light blue-green leaf-like shape that points upwards, the tip of which touches the top of the canvas.  The background is a swirling blending combination of green and yellow on the left, and orange, green, rust and black on the right.  In the lower left corner is a grey leaf-like extension on black.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 18 x 14 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Skunk Cabbage, 1922. Oil on canvas, 18 x 14 inches. Georgia O'Keeffe Museum. Gift of The Burnett Foundation. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum. [2007.1.16]","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/786502/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/786502"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}